** Purpose
Query language for Org files — like SQL for your TODOs. Write views like
"all TODOs tagged :guix: modified in the last 7 days." Pairs with
org-ql-view for saved, reusable searches.

** Setup

*** Config
#+begin_src emacs-lisp
(advice-add 'global-hl-line-highlight :around
  (lambda (orig &rest args)
    (ignore-errors (apply orig args))))

(defun my/org-ql-search ()
  (interactive)
  (org-ql-search (org-agenda-files) '(todo)))
#+end_src

** Saved Views

*** Config
#+begin_src emacs-lisp
(setq org-ql-views
      '(("Guix — last 7 days"
         :buffers-files org-agenda-files
         :query (and (todo)
                     (tags "guix")
                     (ts :from -7))
         :sort (date priority)
         :title "Guix — last 7 days")

        ("MappingOS — in progress"
         :buffers-files org-agenda-files
         :query (and (todo "DOING")
                     (tags "mappingos"))
         :sort (date priority)
         :title "MappingOS — in progress")

        ("High priority — all"
         :buffers-files org-agenda-files
         :query (and (todo)
                     (priority "A"))
         :sort (date)
         :title "High priority — all")))
#+end_src

